# Licence

This repository contains three kinds of work under three different terms.

| What | Terms |
| --- | --- |
| The Editorial Intelligence method — frameworks and principles | CC BY 4.0 |
| Narratives, field notes, experiments and commissioned research | Published for reading. All rights reserved. |
| Site code | MIT |

## 1. The Editorial Intelligence method — CC BY 4.0

