You are free to share and adapt this material for any purpose, including
commercially, provided you give appropriate credit.

Attribution: Asavin Wattanajantra — https://www.editorialintelligence.co

Full licence: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
Legal code: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode

This covers the following, in `website/src/content/frameworks/`:

- Editorial Intelligence Framework
- Narrative Architecture
- Customer Signal Framework
- The Evidence Engine
- Portable Intelligence
- The Daily OS
- Workflow Library
- Case Study Intelligence Framework
