- Product Marketing Framework
- Editorial Intelligence for product teams

## 2. Everything else — published for reading

All other content is published to be read. All rights reserved. You may quote it
with attribution under normal fair dealing; you may not republish, adapt or
redistribute it.

This applies to:

- Narratives — `website/src/content/narratives/`
- Field notes and articles — `website/src/content/writing/`
- Experiments — `website/src/content/experiments/`
- Any framework developed in the course of a client or employer engagement,
  whether or not it is named below

The frameworks currently in that last category, excluded from the CC BY grant in
section 1:

- The AI Maturity Curve
- Editorial Intelligence and Agentic AI
- MTD Operational Reset
- MTD Pricing Framework
- Content Activation Framework

These draw on research, survey data, events and editorial work produced with
clients and employers. The rights in that underlying material are not mine alone
to license onward, so they are not offered for reuse.

**Rule for new work:** a document belongs in section 2, not section 1, if it
reports or is substantially built on research, data or editorial work produced
in the course of a client or employer engagement. When in doubt, section 2.

